<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\SE\glass-ice1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, are you asleep?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Hm!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―So you were asleep after all... Is Zahha that comfy to sleep in?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\ザッハジュース.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ah, no, sorry. Once it starts getting warm, I just can't help it..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on! If I don't get a deviation score of 50 on the next practice exam, my allowance gets cut..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, get it together. You ate the parfait we treated you to, didn't you?</STYLE><PG>
"Hahaha, sorry, sorry. Okay, let's see..."<PG>
"Yeah, I think you both did well. Your translations read naturally."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah, thank goodness..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―It's great having </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1"> tutor us, but classical Japanese really is my archenemy... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, doesn't it bother you?</STYLE><PG>
"Well, Japanese, geography and Japanese history, sure. I'm hopeless at science and math, though."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"How do you get that strong in the humanities?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Even if you ask me how... 
{PAUSE ""}
Haha, well, it's like, I guess I put too many of my science stat points into humanities."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―What kind of game logic is that...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ugh, if only </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="れい">Rei</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-chin would actually do her job as a teacher."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Rei-chin, you mean <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="たにざき">Tanizaki</STYLE>-sensei?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Yeah, yeah. Amazing she ever became a Japanese teacher like that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">She </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ごじ">typos</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> on the board once every five minutes, right?</STYLE><PG>
"Ah, yeah, true... 
{PAUSE ""}
But isn't she bringing it down to our level for us?
{PAUSE ""}
　That way everyone can take her class without tensing up, or something..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, that's way too generous a reading."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―She's a natural airhead, I'm telling you.</STYLE><PG>
"Really? I find Tanizaki-sensei's classes easy to follow, though. 
{PAUSE ""}
Like, I never get bored listening to her."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, they're not boring, I guess? In more ways than one."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Come to think of it, I overheard the vice principal talking with some teacher, and apparently Rei-chin's rating is about the lowest among the teachers.</STYLE><PG>
"Seriously!? I'd think she's top-level when it comes to being approachable."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Apparently that's the problem. She gets too friendly with the students and isn't aware she's a teacher, or something.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ugh, now it's the vice principal I don't like. What's wrong with getting along with students?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Agreed. I'd take Rei-chin."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Her Japanese is weird, but Rei-chin's nice, and cute.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, right! On graduation day the other day, apparently a third-year senpai confessed to Rei-chin!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What!?"<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―What!?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"And apparently it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="みやま">Miyama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-senpai, who was the soccer team's goalkeeper."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Whoa... So Tanizaki-sensei made an enemy of the senpai's fan club!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, seems things are getting pretty fun."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―That rumor's probably why the vice principal and the others were talking about Rei-chin, don't you think?</STYLE><PG>
"So Tanizaki-sensei made enemies all around her all at once... 
{PAUSE ""}
Women are scary..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Seriously, women are scary..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―We're women too, you know... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In classical lit the other day, Rei-chin was talking passionately about how ugly women can be... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Saying women's jealousy goes way back. Apparently it was something else among the nobles.</STYLE><PG>
"I'd hate for Tanizaki-sensei to get frozen out..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't dislike Rei-chin either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―She's staying on as our homeroom teacher next year, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Then we'd better guard Rei-chin properly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey, that means making enemies of the women and the teachers..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Urk...</STYLE><PG>
"But wouldn't that be, in a way, bullying the teacher?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Bullying, or... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hmm, it's a tough call, but if teachers or a fan club harass Rei-chin, that's bullying, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―And I thought Motoki-cho was full of good people. Too bad...</STYLE><PG>
"No, it's too early to say that! I hate that kind of crooked stuff. 
{PAUSE ""}
Apparently, with things like this, telling the board of education mostly gets it handled. The PTA too. 
{PAUSE ""}
No parent wants to send their kid to a school where teachers get bullied, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh, that's our </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Got it! I'll talk to my parents too!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Wait, </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="1">, you sure know a lot about dealing with bullying.</STYLE><PG>
"Huh!? Oh, that's... 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, it's like trivia, or whatever you'd call it... 
{PAUSE ""}
R-right! If you'll help wipe out bullying, I'll tutor you as hard as I can so both your grades go up!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"All right! We shall follow the apostle of justice, </STYLE>Niimura-sensei<STYLE ID="1">, sir!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Save Rei-chin and raise our grades!</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
